          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "винить (vinít) — \"to blame\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Она винит себя в этой аварии. Oná vinít sebyá v étoy avárii. She blames herself for this accident."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective. Винить кого в чём: the fault goes after в + prepositional."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "винить (vinít) is the verb made from вина (viná) \"guilt\", which is usually traced to Proto-Slavic vina: to put the guilt on someone."
            }
          ]
        },
